Change: The interpreter shim keeps one LirInterpreter per image across entry
calls, so its per-procedure caches and stacks survive between game calls.
Upstream: not proposed.
Source: research/tour-interpreter-in-tour-host (item 3 of
interpreter-shim.patch, without the spike's roc_shim_tour_keep_interpreter
toggle).

